# kk: rework workaround 10 and disable 17
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/46410 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?
<!-- Describe in detail what your merge request does and why. -->

```
kk: rework workaround 10 and disable 17

The known true value in workaround 10 is placed after the condition to
avoid an interaction with workaround 6 and 17 crashing the Metal compiler.
After this rework workaround 17 is no longer needed.

Fixes: 39f9d1f8e48 ("kk: Use constant address space for load_global_constant_offset")
Signed-off-by: Aitor Camacho <aitor@lunarg.com>
```

Need to run this through all hardware before merging
